  a room
  aka lords market, market square, square, the square
  west to the East Commerce Street
  northeast to the Royal Tunic, one-way
  east to the Jeweler's Shop, one-way
  southeast to the Moneylender's Shop, one-way
  south to the Back Alley
  south is blocked while after jail and not the player has the letter: stay-away-from-maiden-house
  northeast is blocked while Toresal is night: shops-shuttered
  east is blocked while Toresal is night: shops-shuttered
  southeast is blocked while Toresal is night: shops-shuttered
  states: bearings, seen

  {lords-market-by-day}{lords-market-by-night} {gallows-erected}{gallows-erected-seen}

  after the player entering while the Lord's Market is bearings
    phrase fossville-collision
    change the Lord's Market to seen
  end after

  after the player entering while the hanging is gathering
    first time
