## The lovely clothes (`story.ni:5062`): the dirty, purseless first look —
## the daydream once, the men's-clothing flinch every time. Taking is buying
## (the source's redirect), and buying meets the dirty-urchin refusal; `buying`
## is a story dispatch action, so that refusal rides a trait.

create the lovely clothes
  aka clothes, dresses, dress, gowns, gown, ballgowns, ball gowns, velvets, silks, costumes, costume, formal wear, court apparel, apparel, ladies' formal wear
  scenery, plural
